{"id":"fa6fed937be6d560206758271ed789cfd411d32a","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246207","title":"这两年 AI 进步太快了 一年一个新模样","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"knowckx","excerpt":"程序员 - @knowckx - 2024：网页代码补全/问答助手 2025：AI 能认真帮你写代码 2026：AI 可以独立负责一整块开发任务 按这速度，估计明年 AI 可以负责整个小型项目的自我迭代，维","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>2024：网页代码补全/问答助手<br>\n2025：AI 能认真帮你写代码<br>\n2026：AI 可以独立负责一整块开发任务  </p>\n<p>按这速度，估计明年 AI 可以负责整个小型项目的自我迭代，维护，完全不需要人工参与，直接\"许愿式开发\"</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/开发\"><li></li> 开发</a></P><p><span>34 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-04 06:17:32 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146087\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11bd/dd70/494150_normal.png?m=1632640634\" alt=\"sadfasdfa\" data-uid=\"494150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sadfasdfa\">sadfasdfa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 09:11:13 +08:00\">21h 53m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>穿越了吧，一个月一个新模样啦</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146211\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2446/b4e5/90581_normal.png?m=1789769894\" alt=\"kennylam777\" data-uid=\"90581\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kennylam777\">kennylam777</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 10:55:16 +08:00\">20h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其實只要有合適的 feedback 機制, 讓 AI 知道發生了問題然後去查, 然後給予足夠的權限去修正及發佈, 現在已經可以自我維護了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146261\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8f1579d7553eca43d05972495847751a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jinsongzhaocn\" data-uid=\"460727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jinsongzhaocn\">jinsongzhaocn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 11:37:00 +08:00\">19h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在新闻媒体已经开始谈自进化了，媒体应该会落后前沿科技，可能顶级实验室已经开始自进化了，如果不是最后还需要人审核，可能一天一个版本。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146262\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cb9/ed4f/3021_normal.png?m=1399293315\" alt=\"akira\" data-uid=\"3021\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akira\">akira</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 11:37:16 +08:00\">19h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大部分人 还是只会 25 年的 vibe coding 的 用法</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146275\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5bc041c0b77f97d5227898d46892cfc9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"noogler67\" data-uid=\"253471\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noogler67\">noogler67</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 11:46:06 +08:00\">19h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我还是老式 vibe code 方式。我感觉 ai 写的代码有时候过于复杂。我都要让 ai 尽量简化的。ai 自己维护，最后项目复杂度会无法控制吗。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146281\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/935c3b660aacf5dfeed7a1f3822eb82b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"red13\" data-uid=\"631457\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/red13\">red13</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 11:49:54 +08:00\">19h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前 AI 还无法逾越的两个问题是 AI 没有主观能动性和 AI 无法自动收敛</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146289\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51fd/c72d/674984_normal.png?m=1776852151\" alt=\"Rust2015\" data-uid=\"674984\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rust2015\">Rust2015</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 11:56:09 +08:00\">19h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>什么是氛围编程：这就是 Vibe Coding</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146359\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4108/491b/264870_normal.png?m=1614871631\" alt=\"kiripeng\" data-uid=\"264870\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kiripeng\">kiripeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 13:23:36 +08:00\">17h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>进步太多，导致不需要那么多人了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146385\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/602a/1e42/177637_normal.png?m=1789906399\" alt=\"xujinkai\" data-uid=\"177637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xujinkai\">xujinkai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 13:49:24 +08:00\">17h 15m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我年初的时候还是复制粘贴那么用的，现在已经全自动了，明年我都不敢想</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146392\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 14:01:17 +08:00\">17h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>人类的态度的变化也是贼快。<br>刚开始 v 站一堆帖子都说 ai 是成语接龙，一个个叭叭的还分析呢。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146437\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7891/3b36/337005_normal.png?m=1754991763\" alt=\"knowckx\" data-uid=\"337005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/knowckx\">knowckx</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 14:49:31 +08:00\">16h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xujinkai\">xujinkai</a> 我和你差不多 年初的时候刚用 AI 直接下场写代码 现在已经很多实现直接让 AI 来了<br>@<a href=\"/member/txican\">txican</a> 大模型自动迭代自己的时刻要到了 不敢想这进化速度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146442\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7891/3b36/337005_normal.png?m=1754991763\" alt=\"knowckx\" data-uid=\"337005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/knowckx\">knowckx</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 14:51:58 +08:00\">16h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Rust2015\">Rust2015</a> 氛围编程还是需要一个人在那里指导它一下的 下一步就是全自动的氛围编程 直接许愿</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146479\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c592c990ee6e77be0eb2f0e11f7f6d5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"smyle\" data-uid=\"367242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/smyle\">smyle</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 15:24:39 +08:00\">15h 40m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>年初的时候 claude 给普通用户的上下文还只有 200K ，现在感觉 200K 是很遥远的事</p><p>今年 3 月我还跟朋友聊起过，社区认为 gemini 的产品组合和落地做得很好，在市场上高歌猛进，openai 还因此宣布进入紧急状态以应对 gemini 。结果不出两个月，gemini 的网上口碑变成了路边一条，“人员士气低落”</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146566\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f6d728141d880c96ef399e57ae56b339?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"obiah666\" data-uid=\"573483\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/obiah666\">obiah666</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 16:51:08 +08:00\">14h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的。年初的时候，用到了 opus4.6 极其的惊艳。从此再也不手写代码了。现在模型的能力越来越强。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146735\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/08ea/c1d7/30072_normal.png?m=1534696408\" alt=\"huafang\" data-uid=\"30072\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/huafang\">huafang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 19:42:16 +08:00\">11h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我已经 AI 写了好几套 CMSCRM</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147002\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8b48/8163/578124_normal.png?m=1733024069\" alt=\"wtfwc\" data-uid=\"578124\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wtfwc\">wtfwc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:14:02 +08:00\">7h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我只关心啥时候才能让硅胶娃娃像个真正的人和我互动，AI 说还要等 15-20 年，那时候我 TM 都老了，这发展速度慢死人</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147018\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6be52f2bbe9c1bf2c71f99aa1bf737ab?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Peek\" data-uid=\"566875\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Peek\">Peek</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:33:09 +08:00\">7h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看实体 AI 吧，这东西才关键</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147159\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/00d1b0a8010d28b6912bfd4cb999756f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xue777hua\" data-uid=\"66054\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xue777hua\">xue777hua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 04:27:52 +08:00\">2h 37m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a> 现在依然是成语接龙。</p><p>随便说一个：楼上有人抱怨 过度防御。没办法啊 为了防止接龙接错了，干脆给你都接上，这就叫“稳稳接住你”😋</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147161\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 04:48:33 +08:00\">2h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>很快 AI 巨大的破坏力就会显现</p><p>好的剧本有把枪出现在桌上，子弹一定会飞出</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147166\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2124c8aba1b20643d71a5101a519a80d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zerovoid\" data-uid=\"263784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zerovoid\">zerovoid</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 04:59:06 +08:00\">2h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我看挺多人都好焦虑的，<br>其实一个职业消亡了，自然会出现一个新的职业，<br>毕竟职业是死的，人是活的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"2024：网页代码补全/问答助手 2025：AI 能认真帮你写代码 2026：AI 可以独立负责一整块开发任务 按这速度，估计明年 AI 可以负责整个小型项目的自我迭代，维护，完全不需要人工参与，直接\"许愿式开发\" AI 代码 开发34 replies • 2026-10-04 06:17:32 +08:00 1 sadfasdfa 21h 53m ago via iPhone 穿越了吧，一个月一个新模样啦 5 kennylam777 20h 9m ago 其實只要有合適的 feedback 機制, 讓 AI 知道發生了問題然後去查, 然後給予足夠的權限去修正及發佈, 現在已經可以自我維護了 6 jinsongzhaocn 19h 28m ago 现在新闻媒体已经开始谈自进化了，媒体应该会落后前沿科技，可能顶级实验室已经开始自进化了，如果不是最后还需要人审核，可能一天一个版本。 7 akira 19h 27m ago 大部分人 还是只会 25 年的 vibe coding 的 用法 8 noogler67